<title>POLAND: NBP raises max 14-day rev repo rate to 19.05 pct.</title>
<headline>NBP raises max 14-day rev repo rate to 19.05 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland said it raised the maximum accepted 14-day reverse repo rate to 19.05 percent from 18.95 percent on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The average accepted rate was 18.96 percent, up from 18.45 percent yesterday.</p>
<p>The bank drained 1.48 billion zlotys from the market after banks bid to place 1.53 billion with it.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 2 653 9700</p>
